 "what": "detection probability of the judged-pair spot check's < 0.90 rule (prereg DRAFT v3 \u00a713.5, R15); exact binomial, a planning calculation, no study data",
 "rule": "fires when owner-judge agreement (n - X) / n < 0.90 at the point estimate",
